                                                "sense_id": "44bcba74-f542-3475-a758-9671d13c0ab2",
                                                "text": "For example, analysis of Thoreau's poem “Sympathy” (“Lately, alas, I knew a gentle boy\") is enriched by considering its homoromanticism."
